{"counts":{"canonical":15,"context":0,"total":15,"unknown_date":0,"unlinked":0},"events":[{"aliases":["Chinchorro","丧葬","遗体处理"],"body":[],"categories":["宗教","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["钦乔罗文化"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-6abcf6ce3331b30f63ffec6d","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-6abcf6ce3331b30f63ffec6d","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-5497db2bba26e3b36f16fc2b","summary":"钦乔罗文化的海洋狩猎采集群体，约在公元前5450至前890年生活于今智利北部干旱的阿塔卡马沿海。海洋资源是其生计的重要基础，遗址中发现用骨、贝壳以及矿物和植物材料制作的工具，也保存了格外复杂的葬俗证据。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前5450—前890年","end_year":-890,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-5450},"title":"钦乔罗海洋采集群体发展人工木乃伊葬俗"},{"aliases":["Prehistoric Pile Dwellings around the Alps","居住建筑","环境利用"],"body":[],"categories":["科技","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-a536f3f65d5c123aab2dee06","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-a536f3f65d5c123aab2dee06","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-843c3d0b25516b22aa225af7","summary":"约公元前5000至前500年，阿尔卑斯及周边人群在湖岸、河边和湿地附近营建桩上聚落。列入世界遗产的系列包含多个国家的一百余处遗址，记录了新石器时代至青铜时代不同群体的居住方式。它们不是一座持续存在的城市，而是一组跨越漫长时期的聚落材料。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前5000—前500年","end_year":-500,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-5000},"title":"阿尔卑斯周边群体营建水边桩上聚落"},{"aliases":["Dholavira: a Harappan City","水管理","城市"],"body":[],"categories":["科技","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["哈拉帕文明"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-6830125453e8b2be3b08e47b","images":[{"caption":"多拉维拉水管理、排水通道的现存遗迹，2022年摄影。","creator":"Prof Ranga Sai","credit":"Prof Ranga Sai / Wikimedia Commons / CC BY-SA 4.0","depiction_type":"modern_site_photograph","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","obligations":["保留作者、来源和许可证链接。","如改编图像，注明修改并以相同或兼容许可分享改编图像。","不对图像另加与本许可冲突的使用限制。"],"rights_revision_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=File%3AManholes+at+Dholavira+water+management+network.jpg&oldid=1223758466","sha256":"d3378781314189482ae79db296303fb91c03b188b0bde4e589d07d33eb87481e","source_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Manholes_at_Dholavira_water_management_network.jpg","src":"/api/history/assets/AS-d3378781314189482ae79db296303fb91c03b188b0bde4e589d07d33eb87481e.jpg"}],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-6830125453e8b2be3b08e47b","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-749abc2d3b0a0a310802e810","summary":"多拉维拉属于哈拉帕文明，位于今印度古吉拉特邦干旱的卡迪尔岛地，约在公元前3000至前1500年间有人居住。两条季节性溪流为城市提供稀缺水源，复杂的水管理设施成为理解这里如何维持生活的重要部分，也显示居民必须适应供水具有季节性的环境。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前3000—前1500年","end_year":-1500,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-3000},"title":"多拉维拉居民使用复杂水管理系统"},{"aliases":["The Neolithic Settlement of Burzahom","居住建筑","生活史"],"body":[],"categories":["科技","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-a931b99a7f349b23461c292e","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-a931b99a7f349b23461c292e","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-7ac51d7f8dec2be8692d30ee","summary":"布尔扎霍姆遗址位于克什米尔地区，约公元前3000至前1000年的序列保存了居住形式的变化。早期居民在天然土中开挖圆形或椭圆形坑室，坑口附近的柱洞，使研究者推测上部曾有遮蔽物。坑内及地面附近的炉址等材料，为理解居住活动提供了线索。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前3000—前1000年","end_year":-1000,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-3000},"title":"布尔扎霍姆群体由坑穴住居转向地面泥砖建筑"},{"aliases":["Emergence of herding in the Upper Yellow River region","畜牧","农业","区域交流"],"body":[],"categories":["科技","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-03780da0c8f58858f4b272c0","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-03780da0c8f58858f4b272c0","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-45e25f6ddffe761de40d1488","summary":"黄河上游约公元前三千纪中叶至二千纪中叶的生计变化，并非所有社区同时转向同一种牧业。二〇二六年的一项研究汇总五十四处聚落与墓地资料，考察从中亚或蒙古地区传入的家养群居动物，如何被纳入当地原有的农业和生活方式。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前2500—前1500年","end_year":-1500,"kind":"duration","precision":"year_range","start_year":-2500},"title":"黄河上游畜牧与猪粟农业的结合"},{"aliases":["Kingdom of Kerma","早期国家"],"body":[],"categories":["政治","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["努比亚克尔马"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-05f49bff097c6484e3bc0360","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[{"coordinates":null,"label":"Nile River","precision":"named_place","role":"source_mentioned_place"}],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-05f49bff097c6484e3bc0360","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-bfbd3554bb19e569494c9623","summary":"克尔马王国位于尼罗河上游的努比亚地区，以第三瀑布附近的克尔马城得名，教材采用约公元前二四〇〇至一五〇〇年的延续范围。当地居民种植大麦，饲养牛、羊等家畜，村落与都城之间存在贡纳和交换联系，并同埃及及更南方地区开展贸易。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前2400年—公元前1500年","end_year":-1500,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-2400},"title":"克尔马王国时期"},{"aliases":["齐家文化","冶金","陶器","玉器"],"body":[],"categories":["科技","艺术"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-59bd3e60d898d5571270ce11","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-59bd3e60d898d5571270ce11","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-9e26070b464d206dbd9a3370","summary":"齐家文化分布于黄河上游，是新石器时代晚期至早期青铜时代的重要考古学文化，以甘肃广河齐家坪遗址得名。黄锦前的介绍采用约公元前二四〇〇至一五〇〇年的宽断代，把特色陶器、玉器系统和冶金技术并列为其显著特征。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前2400—前1500年","end_year":-1500,"kind":"duration","precision":"year_range","start_year":-2400},"title":"齐家文化的铜器与玉器"},{"aliases":["Kintampo Tradition","食物生产","聚落","农业"],"body":[],"categories":["文化","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["金坦波传统"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-dbf9ead376f59ecd8e779d8c","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-dbf9ead376f59ecd8e779d8c","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-8a2e4d70bc600ab8317becab","summary":"金坦波传统是加纳晚期石器时代的一组考古遗存，所引研究把其大致年代放在校正后公元前二一〇〇至一四〇〇年。半定居的村落、食物生产、具象艺术与个人装饰品，是辨识这一传统的重要线索；其活动范围跨越稀树草原与森林环境。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前2100—前1400年","end_year":-1400,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-2100},"title":"金坦波群体形成半定居村落并从事食物生产"},{"aliases":["Lower Xiajiadian walled settlements","城墙","聚落","建筑材料"],"body":[],"categories":["科技","政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-d9b5514d71acca6488d46bc4","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-d9b5514d71acca6488d46bc4","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-aa2c03119357237eb506e033","summary":"夏家店下层文化主要见于今内蒙古东南部和辽宁西部，通常置于约公元前二〇〇〇至一三〇〇年。相关遗址既有夯土、土坯建筑，也有石砌城墙聚落，建筑材料与聚落形态的差异，为观察这一时期北方社会的变化提供了线索。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前2000—前1300年","end_year":-1300,"kind":"duration","precision":"year_range","start_year":-2000},"title":"夏家店下层文化的土城与石城"},{"aliases":["Oyu Stone Circles","石环","仪式"],"body":[],"categories":["宗教","艺术"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["绳纹文化"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-e6cc7b4e0486faa8f0d8e4dd","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-e6cc7b4e0486faa8f0d8e4dd","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-93439007d334d77e8009af1b","summary":"大汤石环位于日本秋田县鹿角市的大汤川沿岸台地，年代约为公元前二〇〇〇至一五〇〇年。遗址由万座和野中堂两组石环组成，直径分别约五十二米和四十四米，以大小不一的河石组合出多种形状，形成醒目的仪式空间。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前2000—前1500年","end_year":-1500,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-2000},"title":"大汤群体以河石营建仪式石环"},{"aliases":["来源未给独立事件专名；据所列遗址、器物或行动描述拟题。","城市","青铜时代"],"body":[],"categories":["政治","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-081b04f60fafd9b7ce7bbc6d","images":[],"map_reference":{"checked_at":"2026-10-25","kind":"city_reference","label":"二里头遗址","latitude":34.6925,"license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/","longitude":112.69,"note":"本条原文所涉地名已与地点实体核对，采用相应地理范围；不表示精确场址。 地理补录不代表整条史实已经终审。","precision":"city","role":"材料涉及地点","source_title":"Wikidata Q2692927 · P625","source_url":"https://www.wikidata.org/w/index.php?title=Q2692927&oldid=2516919649"},"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-081b04f60fafd9b7ce7bbc6d","record_type":"site","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-b0b7f60595b4e15e7d03567e","summary":"二里头是中原地区早期青铜时代城市遗址，本条保留斯坦福考古中心所刊研究摘要采用的约公元前一七五〇至一五二〇年断代。讲者把它与陶寺作比较，从迁居、人口集中和城市建设考察政治转型，并提出灾害后寻求耕地的人群迁入，是理解二里头形成的一种路径。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前1750—前1520年","end_year":-1520,"kind":"duration","precision":"year_range","start_year":-1750},"title":"二里头早期青铜时代城市遗址"},{"aliases":["Vedic Age","历史分期","宗教传统"],"body":[],"categories":["宗教","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["吠陀文化"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-ee7656bf5f7b0fb5c6ea2f61","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-ee7656bf5f7b0fb5c6ea2f61","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-ca9294b7753aa283a4226b07","summary":"吠陀时代是南亚历史中的长期阶段，教材采用约公元前一七〇〇至六〇〇年的范围，以吠陀宗教文本得名。相关叙述把这一阶段放在哈拉帕城市衰落之后，关注讲印度雅利安语言的人群迁入旁遮普，并逐渐向恒河流域扩展、同原有居民互动的过程。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前1700年—公元前600年","end_year":-600,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-1700},"title":"南亚吠陀时代"},{"aliases":["Poverty Point","土方工程","聚落"],"body":[],"categories":["文化","宗教"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-24e378dd0db2af339a694e5c","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-24e378dd0db2af339a694e5c","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-cc0b3171b3a9c7079fed921d","summary":"庞蒂岬遗址位于今美国路易斯安那州东北部、密西西比河下游的高地。约公元前一七〇〇至一一〇〇年，当地狩猎、捕鱼和采集人群营建并使用土丘、弧形土垄和中央广场，兼作居住与仪式场所，展现了庞大的集体土方劳动。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前1700—前1100年","end_year":-1100,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-1700},"title":"庞蒂岬群体营建居住与仪式场所"},{"aliases":["Djiganyai","珍珠粟","制陶","食物加工"],"body":[],"categories":["科技","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["提希特传统"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-2b65bab28a3d8645a20c5199","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-2b65bab28a3d8645a20c5199","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-7002390232c3e6745cadc2cd","summary":"吉加尼艾位于毛里塔尼亚达尔内马地区，是提希特传统的一处小型聚落遗址。发掘的一块典型陶片中含有植物羼料，其有机成分经加速器质谱测年，得到约公元前一六二〇至一五一〇年的校正范围；这个区间对应样本，不能扩展为整个遗址或传统的统一起讫。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前1620—前1510年","end_year":-1510,"kind":"dating_range","precision":"year_range","start_year":-1620},"title":"吉加尼艾制陶者可能以珍珠粟加工副产物作羼料"},{"aliases":["Shang Dynasty","文字","早期王朝"],"body":[],"categories":["政治","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["商"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-b41382293c427605b9ce9c4a","images":[],"map_reference":{"checked_at":"2026-10-25","kind":"region_reference","label":"商朝","latitude":36.12083333,"license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/","longitude":114.325,"note":"本条主体明确记载商代，地图表示该国家或历史政权的关联范围，不表示精确事件发生地点。 地理补录不代表整条史实已经终审。","precision":"country","role":"材料涉及国家或政权","source_title":"Wikidata Q128938 · P625","source_url":"https://www.wikidata.org/w/index.php?title=Q128938&oldid=2523631595"},"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-b41382293c427605b9ce9c4a","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-fa58a75a60edd579a47732a1","summary":"商代是中国早期王朝史的重要阶段，本条采用约公元前一六〇〇至一〇四六年的概括范围。甲骨文字是认识商代的重要材料，尤其来自安阳附近晚期王都的发掘；这些刻辞使研究者能够把考古遗存同王室活动、祖先祭祀与占卜实践联系起来。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前1600年—公元前1046年","end_year":-1046,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-1600},"title":"商代与甲骨文字材料"}],"revision":"7b562b96d0ccc8b5ba7df896452b7871dfa5786438c7d8c232e7723b0fb28b2d","schema_version":"1.0.0","scope":"public_database","sources":[],"time_bounds":{"max_year":2026,"min_year":-10000}}